    "readText" : "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">工学分馆临时闭馆通知</span></strong></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;\">各位读者：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">因学校电力设施检修，工学分馆将停电。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif; color: #e03e2d;\">工学分馆将于7月31日7：00-12：00闭馆。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">请读者离馆时带走贵重物品！！！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">给您带来不便，敬请谅解！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;\">2026年7月29日</span></p>",
    "readTextE" : "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>座位预约注意事项</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">1、座位系统开放预约时间段为01:00－22:00，当日预约次日时间为22:45－23:50。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">2、可使用图书馆单独认证的读者证号和密码登录，也使用学校“统一身份认证”登录。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">     <strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">新生需先通关“小布游戏”才能预约座位，否则登录时系统会提示错误。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">3、读者预约成功之后，进馆刷通道机时即已签到。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">      因刷卡签到涉及多个系统，<strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">对短时间内连续出馆、进馆的读者，系统可能会判定签到失败</span></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">      <strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">短时间内出馆并返回的读者，请在出馆2分钟后入馆。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> 4、系统支持快速预约和自选座位两种方式；预约时段保留30分钟，若未在规定时间内入馆签到，系统将自动释放座位，记迟到违约一次。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">5、读者出馆为暂离，超过暂离时间，系统将自动释放座位，记违约一次。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">     暂离时间为30分钟，用餐时段（11:30-13:00，17:30-19:00）不计入暂离时间，跨越用餐时段的暂离时间累计计算（扣除用餐时段），累计超过30分钟记违约并释放座位。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">     例如：读者10:59暂离，暂离时间11:29结束，此时未返回图书馆，系统会记早退违约，释放座位；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">               读者11:00暂离，扣除用餐时段，读者需在13:00前返回；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">               读者11:05暂离，扣除用餐时段，读者需在13:05前返回；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">               读者11:30-13:00暂离，需要在13:30前返回。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">6、读者离开座位且不再使用时，请务必点击结束使用以释放座位，否则视为违约。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Microsoft YaHei, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, sans-serif;\">7、请勿使用程序脚本、频繁调用接口等非正常方式使用本系统，违者将视情节轻重取消本系统或图书馆的使用权限。</span></p>\n<p> </p>",
