    "agreements" : "<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">使用说明：</span> <span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">总馆</span>B2-B4，C1-C4实行现场预约制度，请到馆后在C1的选座机上进行预约。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">1. 开放预约时间：01:00到22:00可预约当日座位，22:45-23:50可预约次日座位。每天可取消预约2次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">2. 预约方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">智慧珞珈</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">APP及小程序：全部应用--公共服务--图书馆座位预约；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">微信预约：关注武汉大学图书馆公众号，点击我</span> <span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">-- 空间预约--座位预约，首次使用前需绑定本人账号；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">网页预约</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">: http://seat.lib.whu.edu.cn/seat。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. 系统默认使用图书馆单独认证的读者证号和密码登录，也可使用学校“统一身份认证登录”登录。</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #ff0000; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">新生需先通关</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">“小布游戏”才能预约座位</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">，否则登录时系统会提示错误。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4.<span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif; color: #000000;\">读者预约成功之后，进馆刷通道机时即已签到。</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">因刷卡签到涉及多个系统，对短时间内连续出馆、进馆的读者，系统可能会因数据对接问题导致签到失败。</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #ff0000; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">需要短时间内出馆并返回的读者，请在出馆2分钟后刷卡入馆。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">5. 系统支持快速预约和自选座位两种方式；预约到期保留30分钟，如未在规定时间内到馆签到，且未取消预约，将释放座位，记违约一次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">6. 读者出馆后为暂离，超过暂离时间后，系统将自动释放座位，记违约一次；<strong>一般暂离时间为30分钟，用餐时段（11:30-13:00，17:30-19:00）不计入暂离时间，跨越用餐时段的暂离时间累计计算（扣除用餐时段），累计超过30分钟记违约并释放座位。</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">例如：暂离时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">30分钟，用餐时段为中午11:30-13:00。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">读者</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">10:59暂离，暂离时间11:29结束，此时未返回图书馆，系统会记早退违约，释放座位；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">读者</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">11:00暂离，扣除用餐时段，读者需在13:00前返回；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">读者</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">11:05暂离，扣除用餐时段，读者需在13:05前返回；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">读者</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">11:30-13:00暂离，需要在13:30前返回。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">7. 读者离开座位不再使用时，须点击结束使用释放座位，否则视为违约。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">8. 请勿使用程序脚本、频繁调用接口等非正常方式使用本系统，违者将视情节轻重一段时间内被取消本系统或图书馆的使用权限。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 7.85pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">.<span style=\"color: #34495e;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;\">严禁携带食品入馆。安全用电，人人有责！离开座位时请关闭自带设备电源！离馆请带走自己私人物品。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.85pt; text-align: left;\"> </p>",
    "agreementsE" : "<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">Instructions for Use:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The seat reservation system is implemented on-site for floors B2-B4 and C1-C4 of the Main Library. Please make your reservation at the seat selection machine on the C1 floor after arriving at the library.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">1. Reservation Time:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Same-day Reservations:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Available from 01:00 to 22:00.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Next-day Reservations:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Available from 22:45 to 23:50.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">2. Reservation Methods:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Zhi</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">HuiLuoJia</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> App and Mini Program:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Navigate to All Applications &gt; Public Services &gt; Library Seat Reservation.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">WeChat Reservation:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Follow the Wuhan University Library official account, click on Me &gt; Space Reservation &gt; Seat Reservation. Account binding is required before first use.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Web Reservation:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Access the system via the browser at </span><a href=\"http://seat.lib.whu.edu.cn/seat\"><u><span class=\"16\" style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 12pt;\">http://seat.lib.whu.edu.cn/seat</span></u></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">3. Login Credentials:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The system defaults to using the library's individual authentication with your library card number and password. Alternatively, you can use the university's \"Unified Identity Authentication\" to log in. New students must complete \" theXiaobu Game\" before making seat reservations; otherwise, the system will display an error message upon login.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">4. Reservation Options:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The system supports both Quick Reservation and Seat Selection. Reservations are held for 30 minutes after expiration. If you do not check in at the library within the specified time and do not cancel the reservation, the seat will be released, and a breach of contract will be recorded.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">5. Temporary Absence Policy:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">When you leave the library , it is considered a temporary absence. If you exceed the temporary absence time limit, the system will automatically release the seat and record a breach of contract. The standard temporary absence time is 30 minutes. Meal times (11:30-13:00, 17:30-19:00) are not counted towards the temporary absence time. If your temporary absence spans a meal time, the time will be cumulatively calculated (excluding meal times), and if it exceeds 30 minutes in total, a breach of contract will be recorded and the seat will be released.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Examples:</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Temporary absence time is 30 minutes, with a meal period from 11:30 to 13:00.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If you temporarily leave at 10:59, your temporary absence ends at 11:29. If you do not return by then, the system will record an early departure breach and release the seat.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If you temporarily leave at 11:00, excluding the meal period, you need to return by 13:00.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If you temporarily leave at 11:05, excluding the meal period, you can return by 13:05.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If you temporarily leave between 11:30 and 13:00, you need to return by 13:30.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">6. Sign-in Issues:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Due to the involvement of multiple systems in card sign-in, data synchronization issues may cause sign-in failures for readers who exit and re-enter the library within a short period. If you need to leave and return to the library within a short time, please wait 2 minutes after exiting before swiping your card to enter.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">7. Ending Seat Usage:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">When you no longer need to use the seat, you must click \"End Usage\" to release the seat; otherwise, it will be considered a breach of contract.</span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">8. Prohibited Actions:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Do not use scripts, frequent API calls, or other abnormal methods to use this system. Violators will have their access to this system or the library suspended for a period of time, depending on the severity of the offense.</span></p>",
